00:30:44,175 --> 00:30:46,219
[quirky music playing]

507
00:30:46,928 --> 00:30:48,763
Hey, you were freaking cool back there.

508
00:30:49,597 --> 00:30:52,267
- Yeah, I'm pretty cool.
- Yeah, I got goosebumps.

509
00:30:52,350 --> 00:30:54,686
[high-pitched] "You wanna fuck around
and find out?"

510
00:30:54,769 --> 00:30:58,147
- [both chuckle]
- "Enough's enough, you goddamn fuckers!"

511
00:30:58,231 --> 00:30:59,107
[laughs]

512
00:30:59,190 --> 00:31:01,526
Why are you copying me, idiot?
Did you fall in love?

513
00:31:02,193 --> 00:31:03,194
Enough's enough.

514
00:31:04,195 --> 00:31:06,155
Too bad, so sad. I'm Si-eun's.

515
00:31:10,451 --> 00:31:11,411
Are you two dating?

516
00:31:11,494 --> 00:31:12,996
That's not happening.

517
00:31:13,872 --> 00:31:15,415
That's not happening?

518
00:31:15,498 --> 00:31:17,667
We know where each other's at
at all times.

519
00:31:18,501 --> 00:31:21,170
That's just that app's main function.

520
00:31:21,754 --> 00:31:24,048
You should just date each other.
You'd make a cute couple.

521
00:31:24,132 --> 00:31:25,884
- Enough's enough.
- [Yeong-i giggles]

522
00:31:27,010 --> 00:31:28,678
Ah! You little shit.

523
00:31:28,761 --> 00:31:30,138
[music fades]

524
00:31:38,938 --> 00:31:40,773
- [door opens]
- [lock bleeps]

525
00:31:44,360 --> 00:31:46,362
- [door closes]
- [lock bleeps]

526
00:31:47,614 --> 00:31:48,990
- [lock turns]
- [alarm bleeps]

527
00:31:49,073 --> 00:31:49,949
[sighs]

528
00:31:51,159 --> 00:31:52,535
[clock ticking]

529
00:31:59,167 --> 00:32:01,169
- [footsteps approaching]
- [rustling]

530
00:32:05,173 --> 00:32:06,966
Huh? What?

531
00:32:12,263 --> 00:32:13,431
[both] What's this?

532
00:32:14,349 --> 00:32:15,558
You were craving it.

533
00:32:21,898 --> 00:32:24,025
Ugh, I'll gain weight eating this late.

534
00:32:24,692 --> 00:32:27,654
Huh? Wow, look at how late it is.

535
00:32:28,738 --> 00:32:30,740
You are so inconsiderate.

536
00:32:31,240 --> 00:32:33,785
I guess I should eat some just to be nice.

537
00:32:33,868 --> 00:32:35,870
Wow, it looks amazing! [giggling]

538
00:32:35,954 --> 00:32:37,038
What is this feeling?

539
00:32:37,914 --> 00:32:39,457
I just got the chills.

540
00:32:40,458 --> 00:32:41,334
What's with you?

541
00:32:43,336 --> 00:32:45,755
- What do you mean?
- I mean you.

542
00:32:47,256 --> 00:32:49,467
You're being way too sweet.

543
00:32:49,550 --> 00:32:51,386
Huh? Your eyes.

544
00:32:51,970 --> 00:32:53,680
The way you act, talk.

545
00:32:54,347 --> 00:32:55,515
And your face.

546
00:32:56,975 --> 00:32:58,434
It's making me cringe.

547
00:33:05,900 --> 00:33:06,901
[chuckles]

548
00:33:06,985 --> 00:33:08,486
["Self" by Meego playing]

549
00:33:09,570 --> 00:33:11,406
Huh? Huh?

550
00:33:23,167 --> 00:33:24,293
Eat your food.

551
00:33:32,343 --> 00:33:33,636
[Su-ho slurps]

552
00:33:34,137 --> 00:33:35,638
[sighs deeply]

553
00:33:42,937 --> 00:33:45,440
[Yeong-i] Si-eun,
you need to eat something too.

554
00:33:45,523 --> 00:33:46,649
[Su-ho groans happily]

555
00:33:49,610 --> 00:33:51,195
Are you a mind reader?

556
00:33:52,947 --> 00:33:54,073
[slurps]

557
00:33:58,036 --> 00:33:59,203
[music fades]

558
00:34:00,079 --> 00:34:04,584
<i>Well, before I'm an assemblyman,</i>
<i>I'm also a citizen and a father</i>

559
00:34:04,667 --> 00:34:09,714
<i>and am naturally extremely interested</i>
<i>in the youth policies, obviously.</i>

560
00:34:10,548 --> 00:34:12,300
- [papers rustling]
- [soft gasping]

561
00:34:15,928 --> 00:34:17,680
[muffled sobbing]

562
00:34:31,903 --> 00:34:33,112
What?

563
00:34:38,034 --> 00:34:39,660
[sighs]

564
00:34:41,496 --> 00:34:42,622
[exhales]

565
00:34:46,751 --> 00:34:50,296
Why did I ever bring you here?

566
00:34:51,422 --> 00:34:52,840
[sighs] You are…

567
00:34:55,802 --> 00:34:58,513
just the wrong kind of breed.

568
00:34:59,597 --> 00:35:01,140
[sighs] You know that?

569
00:35:01,808 --> 00:35:03,726
[melancholy music playing]

570
00:35:03,810 --> 00:35:05,144
[sobbing]

571
00:35:08,648 --> 00:35:10,233
[blow lands]

572
00:35:12,777 --> 00:35:13,778
[blow lands]

573
00:35:13,861 --> 00:35:15,363
[Beom-seok sobs]

574
00:35:17,865 --> 00:35:19,742
["Hero" by Meego playing]

575
00:35:30,169 --> 00:35:32,171
[lyrics in Korean]

576
00:36:19,594 --> 00:36:23,848
<i>♪ You are my hero ♪</i>

577
00:36:25,892 --> 00:36:30,479
<i>♪ My little hero </i>♪

578
00:36:31,939 --> 00:36:36,694
<i>♪ You are my hero </i>♪

579
00:36:37,987 --> 00:36:41,908
<i>♪ My little hero… ♪</i>

580
00:36:41,991 --> 00:36:43,993
[lyrics in Korean]

581
00:37:32,667 --> 00:37:37,463
<i>♪ You are my hero ♪</i>

582
00:37:38,798 --> 00:37:43,552
<i>♪ My little hero… ♪</i>

583
00:37:44,053 --> 00:37:45,680
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS
ARE FICTIONAL

584
00:37:45,763 --> 00:37:47,390
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL

